+#### `request/view` — log-only
+
+```ts persistence-catalog
+/**
+ * Host-selected visibility for existing working-history nodes. Nodes added
+ * after this event belong to the selected activity until its next view.
+ * Required on replay: skipping it would expose previously hidden content.
+ */
+'request/view': {
+  viewId: Branded<'SessionRequestViewId'>
+  visibleSeqs: readonly SessionSeq[]
+  scopes: readonly string[]
+  authorizationVersion: number | null
+}
+```
+
