+# 2026-10-19-request-views
+
+English | [中文](2026-10-19-request-views.zh.md)
+
+## Summary
+
+Adds required request/view records and audience-aware token-meter projections.
+
+## Table of Contents
+
+- [Declaration](#declaration)
+- [Compatibility](#compatibility)
+- [Verification](#verification)
+- [Dev Note](#dev-note)
+
+<a id="declaration"></a>
+## Declaration
+
+```yaml persistence-change
+schemaVersion: 1
+id: 2026-10-19-request-views
+baseline: false
+changes:
+  - root: "event:request/view"
+    previous: null
+    after: "5c7ccb76862e93b3cc5290dfc2d5acb57ac61c76321c8ada3fce36fa1be1cba6"
+    decision: same-version
+```
+
+<a id="compatibility"></a>
+## Compatibility
+
+Existing V4 logs remain readable. Older runtimes refuse the new required event. Context-breakdown and pressure state versions advance to 6 and old checkpoints refold. Cumulative billing totals are unchanged. Install both patched packages together.
+
+<a id="verification"></a>
+## Verification
+
+Focused tests cover visibility, restore, detached replay, tool pairing, independent projections, native token accounting, and checkpoint round trips. Existing token-meter and compaction behavior tests were also exercised.
+
+<a id="dev-note"></a>
+## Dev Note
+
+None.
