 <a id="model-experience"></a>
+## Logged request views
+
+A `request/view` event selects which existing surface nodes enter subsequent model requests. Hidden messages remain in the original log; another view can restore them without creating a new Session or Agent. New nodes belong to the current activity until the next view. The host owns selection, authorization and tool-call/result pairing; the Session validates sequence membership and records the decision. Token measurement and compaction consume the same projected messages. Independent message projections remain effective while a node is hidden.
+
+This build exposes `ctx.sessions.requestViewVersion === 1`. A view-bearing log requires this build; older builds refuse its unknown required event. Do not omit or mark view events ignorable when exporting.
+
 ## Model Experience
 
