 <a id="model-experience"></a>
+## Logged request views
+
+The meter prices the current Session message projection, including hidden nodes as zero-price positions. A request/view change clears the previous audience's usage anchor. The context-breakdown and pressure checkpoints use version 6 and refold earlier caches; cumulative provider billing usage is unchanged. Both the Session and Token Meter services expose requestViewVersion = 1.
+
 ## Model Experience
 
 Indirectly, through consumers such as `dsh-compaction-basic`; the service itself adds no prompt, message, schema, tool, or model call.
